            <div xml:id="d1087">

                <pb facs="0926" n="810" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg810"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/16170.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of War to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">War Department</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 13, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary of War presents his compliments to the Honorable The Secretary of
                    State and has the honor to inclose herewith copy of a telegram received from
                    General Funston, September 10, 1915, and a copy of a telegram sent to General
                    Funston, September 11, 1915.</p>



